========================================
PATTERN MATCHING COMPREHENSIVE TESTS
========================================

=== Literal Number Patterns ===
i32 match: forty-two
negative match: minus five

=== Literal String Patterns ===
string match: greeting hello

=== Literal Boolean Patterns ===
bool true: is true
bool false: is false

=== Literal Null Patterns ===
null match: is null
non-null match: not null

=== Wildcard Patterns ===
wildcard: wildcard matched
wildcard fallback: fallback wildcard

=== Variable Binding Patterns ===
simple binding: bound value: 100
binding as fallback: other: 50

=== OR Patterns ===
or pattern small: small (1-3)
or pattern medium: medium
or pattern strings: exiting

=== Guard Expressions ===
guard range: medium positive
guard negative: negative: -5
complex guard: even and > 10

=== Type Patterns ===
type i32: i32: 42
type string: string: hello
type bool: bool: true

=== Object Destructuring ===
simple object: point: 10,20
partial object: Alice is 30
origin check: origin
x-axis check: on x-axis at 5

=== Array Destructuring ===
empty array: empty array
single element: single: 42
triple: three: 1,2,3
literal array: starts with 1, second is 2

=== Array Rest Patterns ===
head/tail: first: 1
first two: first two: 1,2
single with rest: has at least one: 42

=== Nested Patterns ===
nested object: Bob lives in LA
object with array: first item: 1, total: 3

=== Match as Expression ===
direct assign: number: 5
Your grade is B

